[{:db/id "475b7c95-614f-5077-bced-4b9b31077014" :answer/id #uuid "475b7c95-614f-5077-bced-4b9b31077014" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{- 6 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c80d4c44-6df3-5f21-80b1-61ccf01fb4a1" :answer/id #uuid "c80d4c44-6df3-5f21-80b1-61ccf01fb4a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{6}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6e6219a6-d622-59d1-8986-4253dd916b77" :answer/id #uuid "6e6219a6-d622-59d1-8986-4253dd916b77" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K + e^{6 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ffb372c3-9c93-5ad1-bf5a-a0b171230498" :answer/id #uuid "ffb372c3-9c93-5ad1-bf5a-a0b171230498" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{6 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "945c6768-8894-517a-abc7-51f95ec1b2e0" :answer/id #uuid "945c6768-8894-517a-abc7-51f95ec1b2e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K + 6 x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "740b783d-ec67-526d-a1bc-1d35f6175189" :answer-field/id #uuid "740b783d-ec67-526d-a1bc-1d35f6175189" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["475b7c95-614f-5077-bced-4b9b31077014" "c80d4c44-6df3-5f21-80b1-61ccf01fb4a1" "6e6219a6-d622-59d1-8986-4253dd916b77" "ffb372c3-9c93-5ad1-bf5a-a0b171230498" "945c6768-8894-517a-abc7-51f95ec1b2e0"] :answer-field/correct "ffb372c3-9c93-5ad1-bf5a-a0b171230498" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "83abebcd-929f-55a9-a148-d27778f5afb1" :question/id #uuid "83abebcd-929f-55a9-a148-d27778f5afb1" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $y'-6y=0$ for $y\\ne0.$" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y'-6y=0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-6y & =0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =6y \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (6)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (6)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\ln|y| & =6 x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\ln|y|=6 x+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\ln|y| & =6 x+C \\\\ |y| & =e^{6 x+C} \\\\ |y| & =e^{6 x}\\cdot e^C \\\\ |y| & =K e^{6 x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=e^C$ and $K>0.$\n\nWe can drop the absolute value bars by allowing $K$ to be either positive or negative. Therefore, the most general solution is\n\n$$\ny=K e^{6 x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["740b783d-ec67-526d-a1bc-1d35f6175189"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "982ff9b1-ae32-5e5a-a7dc-2b576b8754e4" :answer/id #uuid "982ff9b1-ae32-5e5a-a7dc-2b576b8754e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{12 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c387edae-57a2-5e79-9e57-5be3f5cdab34" :answer/id #uuid "c387edae-57a2-5e79-9e57-5be3f5cdab34" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K + e^{6 x^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5c5c9f23-b6f4-5911-b0e5-a61aab827692" :answer/id #uuid "5c5c9f23-b6f4-5911-b0e5-a61aab827692" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K + 6 x^{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "11295145-9232-532b-9a91-62d09e45ea7f" :answer/id #uuid "11295145-9232-532b-9a91-62d09e45ea7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{6 x^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "79f6e213-4523-57a9-a155-dd7c4558da22" :answer/id #uuid "79f6e213-4523-57a9-a155-dd7c4558da22" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{- 6 x^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7064be0c-9bce-501a-839a-b7be939751a9" :answer-field/id #uuid "7064be0c-9bce-501a-839a-b7be939751a9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["982ff9b1-ae32-5e5a-a7dc-2b576b8754e4" "c387edae-57a2-5e79-9e57-5be3f5cdab34" "5c5c9f23-b6f4-5911-b0e5-a61aab827692" "11295145-9232-532b-9a91-62d09e45ea7f" "79f6e213-4523-57a9-a155-dd7c4558da22"] :answer-field/correct "11295145-9232-532b-9a91-62d09e45ea7f" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "c07fc15d-92cf-5d4a-ac3d-da89047e596d" :question/id #uuid "c07fc15d-92cf-5d4a-ac3d-da89047e596d" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $y'-12 xy=0$ for $y\\ne0.$" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y'-12 xy=0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-12 xy & =0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =12 xy \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =12 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (12 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (12 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\ln|y| & =6 x^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\ln|y|=6 x^{2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\ln|y| & =6 x^{2}+C \\\\ |y| & =e^{6 x^{2}+C} \\\\ |y| & =e^{6 x^{2}}\\cdot e^C \\\\ |y| & =K e^{6 x^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=e^C$ and $K>0.$\n\nWe can drop the absolute value bars by allowing $K$ to be either positive or negative. Therefore, the most general solution is\n\n$$\ny=K e^{6 x^{2}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["7064be0c-9bce-501a-839a-b7be939751a9"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "4fc067a4-b7f1-5870-815a-7f5f267e4aa9" :answer/id #uuid "4fc067a4-b7f1-5870-815a-7f5f267e4aa9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K - 5 x^{2}" :db/ensure :answer/valida