write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\ln|y| & =- x+C \\\\ |y| & =e^{- x+C} \\\\ |y| & =e^{- x}\\cdot e^C \\\\ |y| & =K e^{- x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=e^C$ and $K>0.$\n\nWe can drop the absolute value bars by allowing $K$ to be either positive or negative. Therefore, the most general solution is\n\n$$\ny=K e^{- x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["c24b3c92-af3d-5004-8811-289588535aa3"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "8a535be6-5fd0-59ea-93c1-018e7f1b5796" :answer/id #uuid "8a535be6-5fd0-59ea-93c1-018e7f1b5796" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{3 x^{2} + 8 x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "bf70bdc8-275d-511f-b43b-88bb3a9a1709" :answer/id #uuid "bf70bdc8-275d-511f-b43b-88bb3a9a1709" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{6 x + 8}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "929b160c-5f08-5021-837d-b9e46e9dd224" :answer/id #uuid "929b160c-5f08-5021-837d-b9e46e9dd224" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{x^{3} + 4 x^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "59a830d1-b55d-511e-aea9-005f1a3e7827" :answer/id #uuid "59a830d1-b55d-511e-aea9-005f1a3e7827" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{\\sqrt{x^{3} + 4 x^{2}}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8d969452-2164-5cbe-98bf-bf05149a3635" :answer/id #uuid "8d969452-2164-5cbe-98bf-bf05149a3635" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K e^{\\sqrt{3 x^{2} + 8 x}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f22ac4a5-83ff-5e96-a7cf-68957227ebfc" :answer-field/id #uuid "f22ac4a5-83ff-5e96-a7cf-68957227ebfc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["8a535be6-5fd0-59ea-93c1-018e7f1b5796" "bf70bdc8-275d-511f-b43b-88bb3a9a1709" "929b160c-5f08-5021-837d-b9e46e9dd224" "59a830d1-b55d-511e-aea9-005f1a3e7827" "8d969452-2164-5cbe-98bf-bf05149a3635"] :answer-field/correct "929b160c-5f08-5021-837d-b9e46e9dd22